SUMMARY:Energy Affordability – Residential Sector
DESCRIPTION:Presented by The GreenGov Council and Penn State Sustainability \n\n\n\nAs energy demand continues to increase\, many are experiencing financial difficulties. Join in to learn how organizations are working to relieve some of these challenges across Pennsylvania. \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nOrganizer\n\n\n\n\n\nVenue
